architecture "An order, from intent to receipt"
node Shop role=external tag=WEB sublabel="Customer storefront"
node API role=backend tag=CORE sublabel="Order orchestration"
node Ledger role=store tag=SQL sublabel="Durable order records"
node Events role=optional tag=ASYNC sublabel="Receipts and fulfilment"
Shop -> API: submit order
API => Ledger: commit
API ~> Events: order placed
group Runtime: API, Ledger, Events
highlight API
